(215, 599, 3, 'OffANS-f08a19d2c.txt', 'results/LuVlEBWFMageekhyocrCPttWVquSPR5sJ5onMnVW.txt', 'tbh, I think this is very helpful in learning Java. Besides being easy to understand, the UI it self is also friendly (not confusing). But maybe it is necessary to provide details such as the number of questions that have been done / total and the passing criteria.', '2020-09-05 04:23:17', '2020-09-05 04:23:17'),
